---
// Isolated frequency-tool band after the FAQ (pear tile design, whole card is the
// link). Landing -> tool direction; FrequencyCta is the opposite (tool -> app).
// (Hum redesign 2026-07.)
---
<section class="section freq-band" aria-labelledby="freq-title">
  <a class="cell cell--pear cell--link freq-card" href="/frequency/" target="_self">
    <div>
      <span class="mono-label">Free tool</span>
      <h3 id="freq-title">The 1000 most common Spanish words</h3>
      <p>Meaning, IPA, syllables, and stress for every word, ranked by spoken frequency. No signup, free CSV download.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="go">Open the free tool →</span>
  </a>
</section>
